  "bio": "Artists\nSuppliers\nAbout\nAt the heart of Poznan, Poland, Artline Studio emerges as a sanctuary for those in search of masterful ink work. Specializing in the timeless techniques of realism and black & gray, our ensemble of gifted artists—including the illustrious Dominik Szymkowiak, the enigmatic Japanese Mike, the vivid Frejka, the intricate Wajdecki, and the expressive Ilovetattoo01—craft each piece with an unwavering dedication to artistry. Artline Studio, where skin transforms into a canvas of breathtaking stories.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Poznan, Woj. Wielkopolskie, Poland"
